            "description": "Membuat wallet baru.\n\nWajib: name (min 1 char), currency (tepat 3 huruf, contoh IDR). balance default 0, harus >= 0.\n\nResponse 201:\n{\n  \"message\": \"wallet berhasil dibuat\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 2,\n    \"user_id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"E-Money (OVO)\",\n    \"balance\": 250000,\n    \"currency\": \"IDR\",\n    \"created_at\": \"...\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"...\"\n  }\n}"
          },
          "response": []
